{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"(yeah now that I see it my wording could suggest that, oops, sorry)\n\"I want to say I'm getting better at the last part of the path. Yesterday I felt this weird inspiration to visit Kingsbridge, and had I suppose my best day since arriving in the city. I'm not sure of my way yet, but I hope I can find it.\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T10:35:07.786000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865179670828154900","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
