{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"In a way, alive, however bland that could sound. Better than before. But on the other, wanting more than that. Yesterday all of us gathered there shared a small victory, that inspired us to make bigger plans for the future. But I feel like I could have done much more. 'If you help the swarm, the swarm will help you', is something we always say. And as I am a swarm of my own, I want to honor that as well.\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T10:44:04.436000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865181921701134366","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"he nods \"have you thought much about what purpose you are going to have in this life?  To what end will you work?\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T10:47:53.904000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865182884159553536","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"I have thought of it, but haven't come to any clear answer. I've always been part of a bigger swarm. You'd still be yourself, but part of a bigger whole to work with. Not unlike bees in a hive, but with some more freedom. And anyone would benefit from the swarm doing better as a whole. That's just how the things have been. So that's what I've been doing. Trying to find a swarm.\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T11:01:55.350000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865186413438828596","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
